stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DISABLED
    DISABLED --> SYNCHRONIZING: PLC enable + secure session
    SYNCHRONIZING --> READY: identities/config/camera/model healthy
    READY --> ACQUIRING: exact new session + inspection ID
    ACQUIRING --> PROCESSING: capture acknowledged
    PROCESSING --> PUBLISHED: complete immutable result
    PUBLISHED --> READY: exact PLC acknowledgement
    ACQUIRING --> FAULTED: camera/timeout/config fault
    PROCESSING --> FAULTED: model/latency/storage/queue fault
    PUBLISHED --> FAULTED: payload mutation/wrong acknowledgement
    READY --> DEGRADED_HOLD: low confidence/quality hold request
    DEGRADED_HOLD --> SYNCHRONIZING: cause cleared + explicit reset
    FAULTED --> SYNCHRONIZING: cause cleared + explicit reset
    SYNCHRONIZING --> DISABLED: PLC disable or session invalid
    READY --> DISABLED: PLC disable
    note right of PUBLISHED
      Result is payload-first, RESULT_VALID-last,
      immutable until exact acknowledgement.
    end note
    note right of FAULTED
      No edge state commands motion.
      PLC holds product and owns recovery.
    end note
